### 1. Zaloguj się
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=szymon&password=1234

### 2. Pobierz słownik badań
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/dictionary

### 3. Eksport słownika
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/dictionary/export

### 4. Edytuj wpis
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/dictionary/WBC
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testCode": "WBC",
  "testName": "Leukocyty",
  "categoryName": "Morfologia",
  "unit": "10^9/L",
  "normMin": 4.0,
  "normMax": 10.0
}

### 5. Import słownika (przykład)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/settings/dictionary/import
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "testCode": "WBC",
    "testName": "Leukocyty",
    "categoryName": "Morfologia",
    "unit": "10^9/L",
    "normMin": 4.0,
    "normMax": 10.0
  }
]
